you say something sexual.

15:55.001 --> 15:57.330
- So, I'm-I'm sitting on Santa's lap...
- Oh, dear.

15:57.331 --> 15:59.332
And it's like my whole body
starts to tingle.

15:59.333 --> 16:00.342
Oh, my stars.

16:00.344 --> 16:01.751
And-and then there's, like, a-a deep...

16:01.752 --> 16:03.170
I better loudly drop an Alka-Seltzer

16:03.171 --> 16:04.921
in this glass of water.

16:04.922 --> 16:07.549
Very loud fizzing.

16:07.550 --> 16:09.426
I-I may need to widen my eyes

16:09.427 --> 16:11.386
until they look like
a young girl's Snapchat filter.

16:11.387 --> 16:13.180
Like, sort of a-a warm steam iron?

16:13.181 --> 16:15.345
Okay. It's okay, Meg.

16:15.346 --> 16:19.186
Look, this Santa person
clearly made you very happy.

16:19.187 --> 16:21.515
And I want my daughter to be happy.

16:21.516 --> 16:24.564
Go find your mall Santa, wherever he is.

16:24.565 --> 16:26.568
I love you, Dad.

16:26.569 --> 16:28.361
And thanks for the pep talk.

16:28.362 --> 16:30.238
Hey, I learned from the best.

16:30.239 --> 16:33.579
You know, I played football for
Coach Joe Paterno at Penn State.

16:33.580 --> 16:36.244
All right, team,
remember everything you learned

16:36.245 --> 16:37.954
in practice this week

16:37.955 --> 16:40.713
and forget everything
after practice this week.

16:40.714 --> 16:42.960
Break.

