<i>- ♪ Sleigh ♪
- ♪ Jingle bells, jingle bells ♪</i>

17:35.137 --> 17:37.681
<i>♪ Jingle all the way. ♪</i>

17:39.433 --> 17:42.018
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.
I've got to get in there.

17:42.019 --> 17:44.187
Sorry, sweetie. It's Christmas Eve.

17:44.188 --> 17:47.938
Mall Quiet on the Western Front
closed 900 minutes ago.

17:47.939 --> 17:49.693
Oh, no.

17:49.694 --> 17:52.454
Do you have a big cup
I can pee in for my ride home?

17:52.455 --> 17:54.614
Take my mostly done Jamba Juice.

17:54.615 --> 17:56.617
And merry Christmas.

18:02.456 --> 18:04.874
Wow. There was more in there
than I thought.

18:04.875 --> 18:07.294
- Meg?
- Santa?

18:07.295 --> 18:10.877
Yes, Meg. It's me, Santa.

18:10.878 --> 18:12.865
Oh, my God, there's a bench
right over there.

18:12.866 --> 18:14.509
Quick, let me sit on your leg.

18:14.510 --> 18:16.219
No, that's not what I'm here for.

18:16.220 --> 18:17.554
Yes, it is. Now, sit down.

18:17.555 --> 18:20.307
Meg, no. Meg, no. Get off.

18:20.308 --> 18:22.517
Geez, I'm trying to give you
a heartwarming message

18:22.518 --> 18:23.935
of Christmas joy.

18:23.936 --> 18:26.646
You know, the same feeling
you got when you were five

18:26.647 --> 18:28.440
and I gave you that Malibu Barbie?

18:28.441 --> 18:29.899
How did you know that?

18:29.900 --> 18:32.110
I told you. I'm the real Santa.

18:32.111 --> 18:35.405
I try to visit every mall
at least once during Christmas.

18:35.406 --> 18:37.240
Except Long Island malls.

18:37.241 --> 18:38.533
Those people are a little much.

18:38.534 --> 18:40.493
Oh, no.

18:40.494 --> 18:43.872
I can't believe I, you know,
grew up all over you.

18:43.873 --> 18:46.166
It's okay, Meg. You see, I know

18:46.167 --> 18:49.169
what each and every person
needs for Christmas.

18:49.170 --> 18:52.839
For you, it was your first
time seeing Jimmy Connors.

18:52.840 --> 18:55.884
But the truth is,
it had nothing to do with me.

18:55.885 --> 18:58.511
The Christmas magic lives in there.

18:58.512 --> 19:02.182
And as long as you believe,
it'll always be with you.

19:02.183 --> 19:03.558
Deep inside.

19:03.559 --> 19:05.226
- Inside my...
- Wherever you find it, yes.

19:05.227 --> 19:07.145
Thanks, Santa.

19:07.146 --> 19:08.863
You're welcome, Meg.

19:08.864 --> 19:10.857
Well, I'm off to distribute presents

19:10.858 --> 19:13.234
to boys and girls all over the world.

19:13.235 --> 19:16.071
All right, I'm gonna
put my leg up on this back tire

19:16.072 --> 19:17.529
and take a she-wee.

19:17.530 --> 19:22.035
You know, you don't have to say
everything out loud, Meg.

19:22.036 --> 19:24.746
Wait, are you sure
you're the real Santa Claus?

19:24.747 --> 19:26.081
Yes, I'm the real Santa Claus.

19:26.082 --> 19:28.124
I'm totally real,
so don't tell anyone about this

19:28.125 --> 19:29.626
and don't say anything to anyone.

19:29.627 --> 19:31.544
Merry Chris...

19:31.545 --> 19:33.713
Damn it.

19:33.714 --> 19:35.021
Come on.

19:35.022 --> 19:38.466
I... I-I really got to go
behind the car.

19:43.099 --> 19:44.391
Whoa!

20:05.871 --> 20:07.118
Meg?

20:07.119 --> 20:08.748
Hi. Merry Christmas.

20:08.749 --> 20:10.750
I'm tennis bad boy Jimmy Connors.

20:10.751 --> 20:12.043
How did you get in here?

20:12.044 --> 20:13.545
I came in through your baby's window.

20:13.546 --> 20:14.963
You can just open it.

20:14.964 --> 20:17.257
Men are now just coming in at will!

20:17.258 --> 20:20.009
I heard you had
a pretty confusing Christmas.

20:20.010 --> 20:21.970
Yeah, it's tough being a teenager,

20:21.971 --> 20:24.889
dealing with all these
new emotions and feelings

20:24.890 --> 20:26.266
and streaming platforms.

20:26.267 --> 20:29.436
I remember when I was your age,
I was confused, too.

20:29.437 --> 20:32.897
Then I got a haircut
that I'd keep for 50 years.

20:32.898 --> 20:35.525
You've just got to find
your one thing that works.

20:35.526 --> 20:38.679
You mean a haircut like this?

20:38.680 --> 20:41.621
Meg, I think you're gonna be just fine.

20:41.622 --> 20:45.076
But just in case, here.
I want you to have these.

20:45.077 --> 20:47.186
- Your balls?
- That's right.

20:47.187 --> 20:48.413
Whenever you need me,

20:48.414 --> 20:50.915
just rub my balls, and I'll come.

20:50.916 --> 20:53.501
<i>♪ O come, ye ♪</i>

20:53.502 --> 20:57.298
<i>♪ O come, ye, to Bethlehem. ♪</i>

20:58.799 --> 21:00.968
Good night.